# Warp models

When Warp, Shuttle, or Reed is running a coding step, use the model in `.warp/config.yaml`.

Default: `claude-sonnet-5.5`.

If that slug is not in the Cursor model picker, stop and ask for the slug. Do not silently fall back to a different family. Judgment and notification steps may use a cheaper model; coding and Bugbot-fix loops may not.
